+  "content.dfc077007eff": "The current source defines modes 0–3 as Off, Information, Warning, and Assist. The device parameter is SpeedLimitMode; this wiki retains its legacy catalog key. Source: https://github.com/sunnypilot/sunnypilot/blob/master/openpilot/sunnypilot/selfdrive/controls/lib/speed_limit/common.py",
+  "content.7c32291eab67": "The October 3 forum poll has 10 ratings: five Great, three Good, one OK, and one Bad. Reports include good stopping and lane keeping, alongside vehicle-specific low-speed oscillation and cornering problems. These are driver reports, not a guarantee of performance.",
